.md", "source_location": "L44", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_04_silver_239_semanas_qroo", "label": "Los 7 centros de Q. Roo (Canc\u00fan, Riviera Maya, Playa del Carmen, Playacar, Akumal, Cozumel, Isla Mujeres) con 239 semanas completas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/04-silver.md", "source_location": "L44", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_04_silver_version_mas_reciente", "label": "Una versi\u00f3n por periodo: gana el archivo m\u00e1s reciente; 2,804 cifras semanales revisadas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/04-silver.md", "source_location": "L47", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DataTur corrige sus cifras preliminares; la versi\u00f3n m\u00e1s reciente es la definitiva."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_04_silver_banderas_comparabilidad", "label": "Notas al pie guardadas como bandera de comparabilidad", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/04-silver.md", "source_location": "L49", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_04_silver_nota_isla_mujeres_sep2025", "label": "Isla Mujeres: oferta hotelera actualizada desde el 1-sep-2025, datos no estrictamente comparables (148 semanas marcadas)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/04-silver.md", "source_location": "L50", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_04_silver_nota_cozumel_akumal", "label": "Cozumel (2025) y Akumal (2024): \"datos no comparables con el periodo anterior\"", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/04-silver.md", "source_location": "L52", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_04_silver_ocupacion_promedio_2022_202